Type: Package
Package: msuiter
Title: Mutational Signature Analysis with a Rust Compute Core
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Shixiang", "Wang", email = "wangshx@csu.edu.cn", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Tally, extract and fit mutational signatures across modalities
    (SBS, DBS, indel and beyond). Numerical kernels live in a Rust workspace
    exposed through a stateless FFI, while the R side provides the object
    model, the engine registry and the tidy user interface.
